gn-in path bypasses the second factor"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_adr_018", "label": "ADR-018 OTP SMS sent directly after commit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DECISIONS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "5-minute TTL and waiting user; outbox poll adds latency; supersedes OTP-via-outbox"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_od_01", "label": "OD-01 Provisional doctor hold at booking", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DECISIONS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Counting capacity without a doctor is an assignment problem no DB constraint can enforce"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_od_06", "label": "OD-06 No patient free-text on appointments", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DECISIONS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Avoids collecting medical data"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_od_10", "label": "OD-10 Telegram personal chats only, no patient phone", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DECISIONS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Privacy of patient contact data in staff messages"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_od_12", "label": "OD-12 Hosting in Uzbekistan", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DECISIONS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Data localisation law; legal sign-off pending"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_od_13", "label": "OD-13 RLS not enabled in v1", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/DECISIONS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defence in depth via composite tenant FKs + least-privilege roles + authori